{{#> layout title="Your video is ready"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">{{#if videoTitle}}Your walkthrough video &ldquo;{{videoTitle}}&rdquo; is finished{{else}}Your walkthrough video is finished{{/if}}{{#if duration}} ({{duration}}){{/if}}. You can watch it and download it from My Videos.</p>
{{#if partial}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Heads up: we could not use {{skippedCount}} of your photos, so the video has a few fewer scenes than planned.</p>
{{/if}}
<p style="margin:24px 0;">
  <a href="{{url}}" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#cc785c;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;font-size:15px;padding:13px 24px;border-radius:8px;">Watch your video</a>
</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#6c6a64;word-break:break-all;">Or open: {{url}}</p>
{{/layout}}
